    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主持：晓苏</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Lydia，勤勤，Windy</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：JeffPod</span></p><span></span><p><span>审核及Show Notes：晓苏</span></p><span></span><p><span>第五季制作人：贺贺、瑾</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：唐灿（ig @can.tang）</span></p><span></span><p><span>场地提供：ig@Story Coffee</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a> 什么是 Vipassana（内观）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> 有什么想不开的需要用出家的方式解决？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="646">10:46</a> 十天冥想真的就觉悟了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2975">49:35</a> 看到了自己的脆弱，让我能够接受别人的脆弱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3753">62:33</a> 无论你聪明还是蠢笨，你只要去做，就知道自己走在正确的道路上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4597">76:37</a> 冥想可以提升工作效率吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5184">86:24</a> 冥想不是追求好感觉，而是净化内心、加深对自己的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5587">93:07</a> 用冥想缓解癌症的疼痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6159">102:39</a> 觉察和平等心就像鸟的两个翅膀，能够让你去很好的应对生命当中各种各样的无常</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听，愿所有生灵快乐平和，获得解脱。</span></p>]]></description>
