    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6938e2b13fec3166cf3796b1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6938e2b13fec3166cf3796b1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 10 Dec 2025 03:10:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主持：Lulu Cao</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Siqi, 晓苏</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑、审核及Show Notes：Lulu Cao</span></p><span></span><p><span>第五季制作人：贺贺、瑾</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：唐灿（ig @can.tang）</span></p><span></span><p><span>场地提供：ig @Story Coffee Bellevue</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 想到钱的时候，身体什么感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a>长大的过程中，家庭氛围怎样影响和钱的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 国外和国内体制内的“不得不”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="609">10:09</a>爸爸的人生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">12:09</a> 父母消费观对子女的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 在没用的东西上花的钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a> 花钱买体验以及对花钱的思维转变，穷富思维</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2408">40:08</a> 富足生活vs富有</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> 花钱买时间，钱是链接</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3177">52:57</a> 对赚钱的态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3773">01:02:53</a> 去世了钱花的光吗？养孩子要多少钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4010">01:06:50</a> 赚的最开心的钱？如果所有的钱都没了？花的最值的钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听，祝你成为金钱的主人！</span></p>]]></description>
