  <item>
    <title>S5E5 AI浪潮冲过来了——女性视角聊AI</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/692755c2f8a9e1d1629af685</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">692755c2f8a9e1d1629af685</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 19:49:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主持：Michelle</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Cynthia, Phoebe</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Jeff</span></p><span></span><p><span>审核及Show Notes：Michelle</span></p><span></span><p><span>第五季制作人：贺贺、瑾</span></p><span></span><p><span>场地提供：ig @Story Coffee Bellevue</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="339">05:39</a> 人工智能不等于大模型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="574">09:34</a> 什么叫AGI? 我们还有多久可以到达AGI?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 比起人类被AI统治，先担心AI被坏人利用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a> AI应用双刃剑：无人驾驶、医疗突破；AI让诈骗门槛变低</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">32:12</a> AI对文化艺术领域的冲击 - 人类的审美和创造力不可替代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2337">38:57</a> AI时代，普通人的出路在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2538">42:18</a> AI浪潮会造成普通人下一代的阶级滑落吗？AI时代我们该教给孩子什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3505">58:25</a> AI在生活工作中的应用分享和踩过的坑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3678">61:18</a> ”all in AI“的荒谬；大语言模型适合做什么、不适合做什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4045">67:25</a> 大模型会延续人类的偏见和歧视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4392">73:12</a> AI行业有更多女性会让我觉得更安全</span></p><span></span><p><span>AI浪潮下一些有温度的思考，感谢收听，欢迎来聊天！</span></p>]]></description>
