  <item>
    <title>S4E10 玄而又玄，身心灵</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/689d2a08759c1ff652cef782</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">689d2a08759c1ff652cef782</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 Aug 2025 00:16:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>第四季制作人：Siqi、贺贺</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：楠楠 (心灵教育疗愈品牌Mindful Heart一心创始人)</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>晓苏 (《随机漫谈》主播）</span></p><span></span><p><span>勤勤 (为友创始人，生命教练，生活方式创业者)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Kate (个性化疗愈礼物品牌Storm the Golden主理人)</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Jeff</span></p><span></span><p><span>审核及Show Notes：楠楠</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头片尾音乐：唐灿（ig @can.tang）</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 第四季收官之作：玄而又玄的”身心灵“，它到底是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> “身心灵”其实是一个产业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="533">08:53</a> 纯理性人：学会了打开心，与世界更好地相处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 高敏感人：真正学会用心，人生从此开挂了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a> 作为好学生，我们都是传统教育体系的幸存者，不停在自我阉割</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1101">18:21</a> 为什么开始修行？因为痛苦和人生体系的崩塌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">21:35</a> 当眼前的世界一夜幻灭，我发现内心才是家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> 尝试了各种法门（灵气、内观、易经、瑜伽、呼吸、冥想）以后，算命准吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a> 身体感受到的“一手信息”，内观：闻慧、思慧、修慧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1975">32:55</a> 在巴厘岛傍晚的海边，体会到了与万物合一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2073">34:33</a> 只是一个创造力的管道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2426">40:26</a> 学过八段锦、针灸，给自己扎针，身心是一体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2572">42:52</a> 看似变得神神叨叨了，其实是不断打开自己、打破框架的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 你的心知道答案：flow with the heart</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2909">48:29</a> 科学的尽头是玄学？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3025">50:25</a> 工作超负荷的妈妈vs生病在家的孩子们，“修行“化解了一场亲子矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3445">57:25</a> 在旧金山的地铁上救了一只小鸟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3740">1:02:20</a> 如果你的亲密关系完全不相信“身心灵”，怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4091">1:08:11</a> 爱自己的具像化：抱自己，给自己能量、与自己和解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4295">1:11:35</a> 正念：三分钟呼吸空间，给身心一个暂停，从反应到回应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4433">1:13:53</a> 预知了闺蜜的二胎今年会来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4560">1:16:00</a> 开始变得容易哭，是一件好事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4763">1:19:23</a> “修行”带给你最大的改变和领悟？Kate：生活更加轻盈了，人生没有那么沉重了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4861">1:21:01</a> 勤勤：内核稳定，找到中道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5032">1:23:52</a> 晓苏：我不修行两三年了，重要的是：重新找回儿时的灵性、面对生活的智慧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5292">1:28:12</a>：楠楠：祝福你一心一意，活在当下，人在心在，好好生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听，愿你轻盈且深刻的生活！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64f382bd3fa4090b74fb347b/lkrNZRPD_Y6hiDyBAn5Oxx4GKTy4.m4a" length="130271669" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:29:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmzZ6WoIQDLnWxIWHpdVcGLp1gMb.jpg"/>
