  <item>
    <title>S4E8 为爱撑伞的人：我们的NGO故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6866e3a493fd2d72b86b440c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6866e3a493fd2d72b86b440c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 03 Jul 2025 20:30:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>第四季制作人：Siqi、贺贺</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：Wendy</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Jil、陈莉</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Jil、Siqi</span></p><span></span><p><span>审核及Show Notes：Vicky、Siqi</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头片尾音乐：唐灿（ig @can.tang）</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a></span></strong><span> 嘉宾自我介绍，分享个人成长与职业经历</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a></span></strong><span> 什么是 NGO？它有哪些独特的组织特点？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a></span></strong><span> 听到“华人社区不捐款、不做志愿者”的偏见</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a></span></strong><span> 如果华人不为自己发声，偏见将有可能成为主流叙事</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a></span></strong><span> 嘉宾陈莉的公益起点：源于在加拿大驻华大使馆的工作经历</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">09:12</a></span></strong><span> 西雅图地区公益氛围的观察与体验</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="686">11:26</a></span></strong><span> 最有价值的公益，有时就是长期、持续地“在场”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a></span></strong><span> 在印度志愿项目中遭遇挫折，引发对公益动机的反思</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="816">13:36</a></span></strong><span> 做义工不是“英雄叙事”，而是看见真正的需求，脚踏实地行动</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="887">14:47</a></span></strong><span> 从“甲方”身份转为“乙方”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="931">15:31</a></span></strong><span> 小大师俱乐部（Little Masters Club）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a></span></strong><span> 组织多元公益活动，打破公益圈层中的“白人主导”局面</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1206">20:06</a></span></strong><span> “彩虹工程”：服务残障儿童的非营利组织</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">22:08</a></span></strong><span> 科思自闭症服务社（CARES）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1509">25:09</a></span></strong><span> 如何有效传播并扩大华人在公益领域的影响力</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a></span></strong><span> 公益比创业更难？资金与资源的挑战</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2133">35:33</a></span></strong><span> 远程公益的现实挑战与可行路径</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2366">39:26</a></span></strong><span> 疫情期间，孩子之间的公益接力与感动瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2638">43:58</a></span></strong><span> 对“成功”和“幸福”的重新定义：幸福是来自清醒的选择</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a></span></strong><span> 真正的公益是平等的互动、互相学习和尊重的过程</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a></span></strong><span> 如何找到适合自己参与的 NGO？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a></span></strong><span> 辨别真假 NGO，找到靠谱组织为公益出力</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">55:10</a></span></strong><span> 在华盛顿州如何创办一个 NGO？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3397">56:37</a></span></strong><span> 西雅图地区政府对非营利组织的支持政策有哪些？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3554">59:14</a></span></strong><span> 政府资助申请竞争激烈，如何提升成功率？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3755">01:02:35</a></span></strong><span> 公益不必远大，从身边的小事做起，力所能及地行动</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3895">01:04:55</a></span></strong><span> 慈善的本质是平等——一起学习、一起成长</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听，欢迎留言告诉我们你的想法！</span></p>]]></description>
